      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This isn't really the place to report this.\nIn any case on PC they can hold down the backslash key before loading in which looks like this: \\\nThat will reset their avatar before they load in. Note it cannot be forward slash which looks like this: / This will not work.\nOn Quest Standalone they can instead hold down both Quick Menu buttons to reset their avatar, this works for PCVR as well.",
