  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello, there is a problem with an avatar in a world that is totally crashing VRChat and users are NOT able to even get back on.  I know a few people this has happened to , including myself but i was able to go to my webpage on VRChat.com and reset to default and was able to get back on, but a friend of mine how does not have the vrchat Home on his PC still cannot get back into VRChat.\nAs i was getting all the info of the world and avatar , a kid ,unfortunately , clicked on the avatar and disappeared , i guess he to got kicked off and will not be able to get back onto VRChat.\nThe world is : \nNogi and Lofe's Spider-Man Avatars — by ɴᴏɢɪ \nThe avatar is  TASM 1 Suit (Backpack )\nThx for any help you can give me and everyone else who can not get back on VRChat\n Brad  ...Soulskater7",
